      "source": "化学（第2版），17.4 电势、自由能与平衡",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "assumes": [
            {
              "text": "在标准状态条件下的原电池中，基本上全部的功都与电子从还原剂转移到氧化剂有关。",
              "src": "17.4"
            },
            {
              "text": "如果功 $w$ 由体系做出，则它为负。",
              "src": "5.3"
            },
            {
              "tex": "\\text{V} = \\text{J/C}",
              "src": "17.3"
            },
            {
              "text": "法拉第常数 $F$ 是 1 摩尔电子的电荷（以库仑计）。",
              "src": "17.4"
            }
          ],
          "then": {
            "tex": "\\mk{G}{\\kdGo} = \\mk{w}{\\kwmax}",
            "src": "16.4"
          },
          "steps": [
            {
              "tex": "\\mk{G}{\\kdGo} = \\mk{w}{\\kwmax} = \\mk{e}{\\kwelec}",
              "uses": [
                0
              ]
            },
            {
              "tex": "\\mk{G}{\\kdGo} = \\mk{e}{\\kwelec} = \\mk{x}{-\\kQ}\\,\\mk{E}{\\kEocell}",
              "uses": [
                1,
                2
              ],
              "cap": "电势是单位电荷的能量，所以使电荷 $Q$ 通过 $E^\\circ_\\text{cell}$ 所做的功的大小为 $QE^\\circ_\\text{cell}$；这个功由电池做出，所以为负。"
            },
            {
              "tex": "\\mk{G}{\\kdGo} = \\mk{e}{\\kwelec} = \\mk{x}{-\\kn\\kFaraday}\\mk{E}{\\kEocell}",
              "uses": [
                3
              ],
              "cap": "$n$ 摩尔电子所携带的电荷是 $nF$。"
            },
            {
              "tex": "\\mk{G}{\\kdGo} = \\mk{x}{-\\kn\\kFaraday}\\mk{E}{\\kEocell}",
              "uses": []
            }
          ],
          "src": "17.4"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cell-potential-k",
      "what": "标准电池电势与平衡常数",
      "source": "化学（第2版），17.4 电势、自由能与平衡",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "assumes": [
            {
              "tex": "\\kdGo = -\\kn\\kFaraday\\kEocell",
              "src": "17.4"
            }
          ],
          "then": {
            "tex": "\\mk{G}{\\kdGo} = \\mk{L}{-R\\kT\\;\\text{ln}\\;\\kK}",
            "src": "16.4"
          },
          "steps": [
            {
              "tex": "\\mk{G}{\\kdGo} = \\mk{L}{-R\\kT\\;\\text{ln}\\;\\kK} = \\mk{E}{-\\kn\\kFaraday\\kEocell}",
              "uses": [
                0
              ]
            },
            {
              "tex": "\\mk{E}{\\kEocell} = \\mk{L}{\\left(\\frac{R\\kT}{\\kn\\kFaraday}\\right)\\;\\text{ln}\\;\\kK}",
              "uses": []
            }
          ],
          "src": "17.4"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "nernst",
      "what": "能斯特方程",
      "source": "化学（第2版），17.4 电势、自由能与平衡",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "assumes": [
            {
              "tex": "\\kdGo = -\\kn\\kFaraday\\kEocell",
              "src": "17.4"
            },
            {
              "tex": "\\kdG = -\\kn\\kFaraday\\kEcell",
              "src": "17.4"
            }
          ],
          "then": {
            "tex": "\\mk{G}{\\kdG} = \\mk{G0}{\\kdGo} + \\mk{L}{R\\kT\\;\\text{ln}\\;\\kQrxn}",
            "src": "16.4"
          },
          "steps": [
            {
              "tex": "\\mk{G}{-\\kn\\kFaraday\\kEcell} = \\mk{G0}{-\\kn\\kFaraday\\kEocell} + \\mk{L}{R\\kT\\;\\text{ln}\\;\\kQrxn}",
              "uses": [
                1,
                0
              ],
              "cap": "无论在什么条件下，自由能与电势的关系都相同，所以正如 $\\Delta G^\\circ = -nFE^\\circ_\\text{cell}$，有 $\\Delta G = -nFE_\\text{cell}$。"
            },
            {
              "tex": "\\mk{G}{\\kEcell} = \\mk{G0}{\\kEocell} - \\mk{L}{\\;\\frac{R\\kT}{\\kn\\kFaraday}\\;\\text{ln}\\;\\kQrxn}",
              "uses": []
            }
          ],
          "src": "17.4"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
